# Build-context allow-list (last matching pattern wins): only what the image build consumes
# enters the build. The Dockerfile reads only rootfs/ — the Supervisor consumes everything else
# in the app dir (config.yaml, apparmor.txt, translations/, docs, icons) from the repo, not the
# image. If a Dockerfile ever COPYs beyond rootfs/, re-include that file here.
*
!rootfs/
!Dockerfile
